ProtocolFeeCollector::setUsmRegistry
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new USM registry is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
    ├── when new USM registry equals the current registry
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorNoStateChange
    └── when new USM registry is valid and different
        ├── it should update usmRegistry
        └── it should emit UsmRegistryUpdated
